{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [system-destroy]: recursive chown on a system or root path overwrites ownership of system files. Target a subdirectory you own. [command-sha256:d73592ba9969fc72ca376353f67bb480e18b3033213638c75e23a0c7fbe07f3f] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
